ONE THING FOUND WHILE IMPLEMENTING, and closed rather than smoothed over:
allow_bignum whitelists Math::BigFloat and Math::BigInt for every value, not
just our carrier, so a CALLER-supplied one -- which the encoder previously
refused outright -- would have been emitted as a bare JSON number silently.
